{
  "caption": "謝謝每一位來到 Sydney 演唱會的朋友們 \n在演唱的時刻 如果能讓你們在某個瞬間找回當年的感動 或是為生活帶來一些溫暖與力量 那我來到這裡開這場演唱會 就值得了 Thank you to everyone who came to my Sydney concert.\nIf, even for a moment during the show, my music brought back some of those special memories and feelings from the past, or brought a little warmth and strength into your lives, then coming all the way here to perform for you was truly worth it.",
